<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper B · Answer guide</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/b/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper B</p><h1>Paper B · Answer guide</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper B</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 20 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. What will the man do next?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 小何来帮我们照顾猫以前，家里要准备什么？</p><p class="cn">male · 你把猫粮放在桌上，我去把备用钥匙交给小何，猫的水我已经换好了。</p><p class="cn">female · 好，我现在准备猫粮。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 换猫的水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 交备用钥匙</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 准备猫粮</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>He will give the spare key to the sitter.</p><p class="cn">男生接下来交备用钥匙。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我去把备用钥匙交给小何</p><ul><li>A: He says the water has already been changed.<br>猫的水已经换好，不是下一步。</li><li>C: The woman is preparing the food.<br>准备猫粮是女生的任务。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. When does the teacher-led pet-care activity start?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 今天下午的宠物照顾活动几点开始？</p><p class="cn">female · 四点。三点半大家可以先看照片，四点老师教我们怎么给小狗梳毛，五点再提问题。</p><p class="cn">male · 我四点前到。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午三点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午四点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The teacher begins the pet-care demonstration at four.</p><p class="cn">老师四点开始教宠物照顾。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 四点老师教我们怎么给小狗梳毛</p><ul><li>A: Three thirty is the optional photo-viewing time.<br>三点半是提前看照片的时间。</li><li>C: Five is the question period.<br>五点才进入提问环节。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. How long does the speaker normally take the dog out each time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 放学以后，我每次带小狗出去二十分钟。哥哥今天问我要不要走四十分钟，可是小狗走久了会累，我还是按平时的时间走。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 四十分钟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两个小时</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二十分钟</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>She states that each normal outing lasts twenty minutes.</p><p class="cn">她明确说平时每次二十分钟。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我每次带小狗出去二十分钟</p><ul><li>A: Forty minutes is the longer suggestion she does not adopt.<br>四十分钟是她没有采用的建议。</li><li>B: Two hours is not stated.<br>材料没有说两小时。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Which class can the woman try within her available time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 你想学打球还是游泳？</p><p class="cn">female · 我想游泳，可是只有周三晚上有空。</p><p class="cn">male · 游泳课周二晚上开，周三有篮球课。</p><p class="cn">female · 那先试试篮球课吧。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周二游泳课</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 周三游泳课</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 周三篮球课</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Basketball is offered on the only evening she is free.</p><p class="cn">只有周三有空，而周三开篮球课。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 游泳课周二晚上开，周三有篮球课</p><ul><li>A: Swimming is on Tuesday, when she is not free.<br>游泳课在她没空的周二。</li><li>B: No Wednesday swimming class is offered.<br>材料没有周三游泳课。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. What does Xiaoding’s preparation suggest he has learned?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 上次打球，小丁忘了带水，打完以后一直说口渴。今天他还没出门，就先往书包里放了一大瓶水，旁边的球鞋倒是差点儿忘了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 打球要记得带水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 球鞋完全不需要带</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 打完球也不会口渴</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Remembering water before leaving addresses his previous thirsty experience.</p><p class="cn">提前放水对应上次忘带水又口渴的经历。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 上次打球，小丁忘了带水，打完以后一直说口渴。今天他还没出门，就先往书包里放了一大瓶水</p><ul><li>B: Nearly forgetting shoes does not mean they are unnecessary.<br>差点忘鞋不等于球鞋不需要。</li><li>C: He explicitly felt thirsty last time.<br>上次明确口渴，不能说不会口渴。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. At which part of the sports centre will they meet?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 你到了运动中心就在游泳馆等我吧。</p><p class="cn">female · 我不游泳，今天要上篮球课。我们在篮球馆门口见，别走到游泳馆去。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，我去篮球馆。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 游泳馆里面</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 中心外的商店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 篮球馆门口</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The final meeting point is the basketball hall entrance.</p><p class="cn">最后确认在篮球馆门口见。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我们在篮球馆门口见</p><ul><li>A: The swimming hall is explicitly rejected.<br>游泳馆被明确否定。</li><li>B: No outside shop is named as the meeting point.<br>没有约定去外面的商店。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. Which means of transport do they choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 公交车还要等半个小时，你想怎么去运动中心？</p><p class="cn">male · 我们的自行车都在这儿，骑车只要十分钟。</p><p class="cn">female · 好，把球放进车篮，我们骑车去。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 等公交车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 坐出租车</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 骑自行车</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>They decide to cycle using their available bicycles.</p><p class="cn">双方决定骑现有的自行车。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我们骑车去</p><ul><li>A: They choose not to wait for the bus.<br>他们没有选择继续等公交车。</li><li>B: A taxi is not proposed.<br>材料没有提出出租车。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. What is the first step after entering the west gate?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 从西门进去以后，怎么到篮球馆？</p><p class="cn">female · 先穿过小广场，看到食堂再向左。篮球馆在食堂后面，不在停车场旁边。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，先过广场。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 向食堂左转</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 穿过小广场</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去停车场</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Crossing the little square comes before the turn.</p><p class="cn">先穿过广场，之后才在食堂处转弯。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 先穿过小广场，看到食堂再向左</p><ul><li>A: The left turn comes after crossing the square.<br>左转不是进门第一步。</li><li>C: The parking area is not on the given route.<br>给出的路线不是去停车场。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which bus fits the man’s arrival and luggage needs?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 六路车两点前到运动中心，不用换车。十路车也能两点前到，可是中间要换一次。</p><p class="cn">male · 我带着两个球和一个大包，不想换车，坐六路吧。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六路车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十路车</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两路车都来不及</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Bus six arrives before two and avoids a transfer with his equipment.</p><p class="cn">六路两点前到，又不用带东西换车。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 六路车两点前到运动中心，不用换车</p><ul><li>B: Bus ten meets the arrival time but requires a transfer.<br>十路时间合适，但要换车。</li><li>C: Both routes are said to arrive before two.<br>两条线路都能两点前到，不能说都来不及。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. What is the updated training arrangement?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 星期六下午三点太热，室外练球还照原计划吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 老师说改到早上八点，地点不变，还是学校球场。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，我把原来下午的提醒改掉。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 早上八点在学校球场</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三点在学校球场</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 早上八点在体育馆</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Training moves to eight in the morning at the same school court.</p><p class="cn">训练改到早上八点，仍在学校球场。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 改到早上八点，地点不变，还是学校球场</p><ul><li>B: Three in the afternoon is the replaced time.<br>下午三点是更改前的时间。</li><li>C: No move to an indoor gym is stated.<br>材料没有改到体育馆。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. How many cartons of juice will they bring?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 野餐要带几盒果汁？</p><p class="cn">male · 原来六个人，现在只有四个人去，一人一盒就够。</p><p class="cn">female · 那我带四盒，面包另外买两袋。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，别按原来的人数买。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两盒</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The confirmed juice quantity is four cartons.</p><p class="cn">最后确认果汁四盒。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 那我带四盒，面包另外买两袋</p><ul><li>A: Six was the original number of people.<br>六是原来的人数。</li><li>C: Two refers to bags of bread.<br>两袋指面包，不是果汁。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Which mat will suit the woman’s group?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 你想买哪张野餐垫？小号轻一些。</p><p class="cn">female · 我们四个人，小号只能坐两个人。我买能坐四个人的大号，蓝色和绿色都可以。</p><p class="cn">male · 那拿这张绿色大号吧。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两人用的小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 只要蓝色小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四人用的大号</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The group needs the large mat with room for four.</p><p class="cn">四人小组需要能坐四人的大号。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我买能坐四个人的大号，蓝色和绿色都可以</p><ul><li>A: The small mat holds only two.<br>小号只能坐两人。</li><li>B: Colour is flexible; a blue small mat still lacks room.<br>颜色不限，蓝色小号仍然不够坐。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. How much must the student pay?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 这袋面包原来六块，今天学生买只要四块。纸袋要另外一块。</p><p class="cn">male · 我是学生，自己带了袋子，只买面包。</p><p class="cn">female · 那收你四块。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五块</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The student price is four, and he needs no paper bag.</p><p class="cn">学生价四块，自己带袋子不另付袋费。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 那收你四块</p><ul><li>A: Six is the ordinary original price.<br>六块是普通原价。</li><li>C: Five would add a bag he does not need.<br>五块多算了不需要的纸袋。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. Which bag meets both practical requirements?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 野餐包要轻一点儿，还要能挡雨。甲包轻，可是怕水；乙包很重；丙包又轻又能挡雨。</p><p class="cn">female · 我们要走很久，天气也可能下雨，就选丙包。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 丙包</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 甲包</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙包</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Bag C is both light and rain-resistant.</p><p class="cn">丙包同时满足轻和挡雨。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 丙包又轻又能挡雨</p><ul><li>B: Bag A is light but cannot handle water.<br>甲包虽轻却怕水。</li><li>C: Bag B is heavy, contrary to the request.<br>乙包很重，不符合轻的要求。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. What must the man do before going to play ball?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 小何六点来照顾猫，钥匙还在你那儿吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 在，但我放学后要去打球，七点才到家。</p><p class="cn">female · 那你先把钥匙给楼下王阿姨，小何来了找她拿。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 把钥匙交给王阿姨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 带着钥匙等到七点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 自己六点回家喂猫</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Leaving the key with Aunt Wang lets the sitter enter before he returns.</p><p class="cn">先交王阿姨，照顾者才能在他回来前取钥匙。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 你先把钥匙给楼下王阿姨，小何来了找她拿</p><ul><li>B: Keeping the key until seven blocks the six-o’clock visit.<br>留到七点不符合六点来照顾猫的安排。</li><li>C: He says he cannot return until seven.<br>他明确七点才回家，不能六点自己回去。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. How will the afternoon compare with the morning?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 早上还比较凉快，只有二十四度。下午会升到三十五度，也没有风。傍晚才慢慢凉下来。今天想去买球鞋的话，最好别在下午最热的时候出门。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 更凉快</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一直有大风</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 热得多</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The temperature rises from twenty-four to thirty-five.</p><p class="cn">气温从二十四度升到三十五度，明显更热。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 下午会升到三十五度，也没有风</p><ul><li>A: Cooling is expected in the evening.<br>变凉是傍晚的情况。</li><li>B: The afternoon is described as having no wind.<br>下午明确没有风，不是大风。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. Why has the match been moved to the evening?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 今天的球赛为什么改到晚上七点？场地没空吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 场地一直能用，是下午太阳太强，大家怕热。晚上凉快一点儿，打起来更舒服。</p><p class="cn">female · 明白了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午没有场地</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午太热</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上门票更便宜</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Strong afternoon sun and heat cause the change.</p><p class="cn">改时间是因为下午太阳强、大家怕热。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 是下午太阳太强，大家怕热</p><ul><li>A: The court is available throughout the day.<br>场地一直能用，不是没场地。</li><li>C: No ticket-price reason is given.<br>没有提到门票价格。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. Which activity fits both of the stated limits?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 我今天想运动，但老师说每次别超过一个小时，也先别跑步。</p><p class="cn">female · 那可以选五十分钟的投篮课。跑步课只有半小时，游泳课却要九十分钟。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，我去投篮。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 半小时跑步课</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五十分钟投篮课</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 九十分钟游泳课</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The fifty-minute shooting class is under an hour and involves no running class.</p><p class="cn">投篮课少于一小时，也不是跑步课。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 每次别超过一个小时，也先别跑步</p><ul><li>A: The running class is short enough but violates the no-running condition.<br>跑步课时间短，但不符合先别跑步。</li><li>C: Ninety minutes is longer than an hour.<br>九十分钟超过一小时。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What did the group do directly after watching the boats?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 端午那天，我们先在河边看龙舟，回来以后听老师讲活动的故事。听完故事，大家才到教室学做香包。我做的香包送给了弟弟，他特别喜欢。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 听老师讲故事</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 学做香包</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 送礼物给弟弟</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>They listen to the teacher before the craft session.</p><p class="cn">看船回来先听故事，之后才做手工。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 回来以后听老师讲活动的故事。听完故事，大家才到教室学做香包</p><ul><li>B: Making sachets follows the story.<br>做香包在听完故事之后。</li><li>C: Giving the gift is later, after it has been made.<br>送礼发生在做好香包之后。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What can we infer about Xiaofang by the end?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 端午活动刚开始，小方说自己手笨，做不好香包。老师陪着她做了一次。后来老师还没走过来，她已经自己做好第二个，又开始教旁边的小朋友了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 她仍然完全不会做</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 她只想让老师代做</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 她对自己更有信心了</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Working independently and teaching another child suggest greater confidence.</p><p class="cn">自己做第二个还教别人，支持更有信心。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 她已经自己做好第二个，又开始教旁边的小朋友了</p><ul><li>A: She has already completed one independently.<br>她已经自己做好，不能说完全不会。</li><li>B: She begins before the teacher approaches again.<br>老师还没过来，她已独立开始。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 25 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What should Xiaoning do after school?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">给小宁的留言<br>兔子的晚饭我已经放在盒子里，六点开盒子就可以。今天放学后，请你先把空水瓶装满。兔笼我早上已经打扫过了，不用再打扫，也不要另外买饲料。<br>爸爸</p></div><p class="note">兔笼: rabbit cage</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 重新打扫兔笼</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 给水瓶装水</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去买饲料</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The new request is to fill the empty water bottle.</p><p class="cn">新的要求是把空水瓶装满。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请你先把空水瓶装满</p><ul><li>A: The cage was cleaned that morning.<br>兔笼早上已经清理。</li><li>C: The note explicitly says not to buy extra feed.<br>留言明确不用另买饲料。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. When does the explanatory talk begin?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">课后宠物小组<br>周五三点半开门，四点开始讲解。四点半大家练习怎样给猫梳毛，五点离开。第一次来的同学请三点四十前到，先登记姓名，不要把到场时间当成讲解开始时间。</p></div><p class="note">梳毛: brush fur</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午三点四十</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午四点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午四点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The talk starts at four.</p><p class="cn">讲解四点开始。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 四点开始讲解</p><ul><li>A: Three forty is the arrival deadline for newcomers.<br>三点四十是新同学到场期限。</li><li>B: Four thirty begins the practical exercise.<br>四点半开始练习。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How long is each outing with the dog?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">照顾小狗的约定<br>这个星期，小安每天放学后带小狗出去十五分钟，回来再准备自己的晚饭。星期三虽然放学晚，也照常出去十五分钟。周末改由哥哥照顾，但每次时间仍然一样。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三十分钟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一小时</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十五分钟</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Every outing is fifteen minutes, including the later school day and weekend.</p><p class="cn">每次都是十五分钟，晚放学和周末也不变。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 每次时间仍然一样</p><ul><li>A: Thirty minutes is not the stated duration.<br>约定没有说三十分钟。</li><li>B: An hour is not the stated duration.<br>材料没有说一小时。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Which class matches Xiao’an’s day and learning goal?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小安的选课卡<br>本周只有周一下午能参加活动，想学球类运动。运动中心周一有羽毛球课、周二有篮球课，周一另有绘画课。三种课都不需要以前学过，费用也都一样。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周二篮球课</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 周一绘画课</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 周一羽毛球课</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Badminton is a ball-related sport available on the free day.</p><p class="cn">羽毛球课既在周一，又符合球类运动目标。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 周一有羽毛球课、周二有篮球课</p><ul><li>A: Tuesday is outside the stated available day.<br>周二不是她有空的日期。</li><li>B: Drawing fits the day but not the sports goal.<br>绘画日期合适，但不是想学的球类运动。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Which preparation is supported by Xiaoning’s record?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">运动后的记录<br>以前小宁一打完球就赶着回家，书包里也总忘放水。昨天教练提醒他带水，并在结束后坐一会儿。他照着做了，回家路上说比以前轻松，打算下次也提前准备。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 带水并留一点休息时间</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 结束后马上跑回家</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把水留在家里</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Preparing water and allowing a rest are the changes linked to his better reported experience.</p><p class="cn">带水和留休息时间对应他感觉轻松的那次经历。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 教练提醒他带水，并在结束后坐一会儿。他照着做了</p><ul><li>B: Rushing home is the earlier routine, not the change he will continue.<br>急着回家是以前的做法。</li><li>C: Leaving water at home contradicts the preparation described.<br>把水留家里与提前带水不符。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Where should the group meet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">集合消息<br>运动中心里有游泳馆、篮球馆和网球场。本周小组的球拍课在网球场，大家直接在那里集合，不用先去售票处等。游泳馆今天只对学校开放，篮球馆下午有比赛。</p></div><p class="note">售票处: ticket office</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 网球场</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 游泳馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 售票处</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The preceding sentence identifies the tennis court as the class venue and direct meeting point.</p><p class="cn">前句指定网球场，要求直接在那里集合。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 大家直接在那里集合</p><ul><li>B: The swimming hall is restricted to a school group.<br>游泳馆今天只对学校开放。</li><li>C: The notice says not to wait at the ticket office first.<br>消息明确不用先去售票处等。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. How is the group asked to travel?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小组交通约定<br>教练会用小巴接大家到运动中心，车上可以放球拍。请九点在学校南门等，不用自己骑车。我们到了中心还要一起检查器材，所以先别一个人提前过去。</p></div><p class="note">器材: equipment</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 各自骑车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 各自提前坐地铁</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乘教练的小巴</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The group is to travel together in the coach’s minibus.</p><p class="cn">小组按约定一起坐教练的小巴。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 教练会用小巴接大家到运动中心</p><ul><li>A: They are told not to cycle individually.<br>约定明确不用自己骑车。</li><li>B: Going ahead alone is discouraged, and no subway arrangement is given.<br>约定请大家不要独自先去，也没有地铁安排。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What should visitors pass first after entering?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">运动中心入口图说明<br>由北门进入后，先经过小花园，到服务台领取活动卡，再按蓝色箭头上二楼。练习馆就在楼梯右边。没有活动卡不能进馆，请不要进门就直接上楼。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二楼练习馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小花园</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 楼梯右侧</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The small garden is the first feature on the route.</p><p class="cn">进北门后先经过小花园。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 由北门进入后，先经过小花园</p><ul><li>A: The hall is upstairs after collecting a card.<br>先领卡上楼后才到练习馆。</li><li>C: The right side of the stairs locates the hall, not the first step.<br>楼梯右边说明馆的位置，不是入门第一步。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Which entrance lets Xiaohe enter before the stated deadline?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">运动中心入口卡<br>东门九点开放，从车站步行十五分钟。西门十点开放，从车站步行五分钟。小何九点下车，要在九点半前进场。进门以后到教室的路程一样，他不能等到十点。</p></div><p class="note">步行: on foot</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 西门</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 东门</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两个门都来不及</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The east gate is open when he reaches it at nine fifteen, before nine thirty.</p><p class="cn">东门九点已开，九点十五分可到，早于九点半。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 东门九点开放，从车站步行十五分钟</p><ul><li>A: The nearer west gate stays closed until ten.<br>西门虽近，却到十点才开。</li><li>C: The east gate provides a timely route.<br>东门能及时进入，不能说两个门都来不及。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. What will the group now do at two in the afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">运动中心活动更新<br>周六下午太热，原定两点在室外参观球场的活动取消，改看一楼展厅里的运动照片展。开始时间仍是下午两点，不需要去游泳馆集合。请把这条新消息告诉其他同学。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 在室外参观球场</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 在一楼展厅看照片展</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 在游泳馆集合</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The replacement is the indoor sports-photo exhibition, at the unchanged time.</p><p class="cn">新安排是室内看运动照片展，时间不变。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 改看一楼展厅里的运动照片展。开始时间仍是下午两点</p><ul><li>A: The outdoor court tour is cancelled.<br>室外参观球场已取消。</li><li>C: The update explicitly says not to gather at the pool.<br>通知明确不用在游泳馆集合。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How many cartons of juice are listed?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">野餐装箱单<br>果汁五盒，牛奶两盒，面包三袋。小林带果汁，小陈带面包，老师带牛奶。名单上有五位同学，每个人可以拿一盒果汁；牛奶是留给另外两位帮忙的家长的。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五盒</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The list contains five cartons of juice.</p><p class="cn">装箱单果汁五盒。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 果汁五盒，牛奶两盒，面包三袋</p><ul><li>A: Two cartons refer to milk.<br>两盒指牛奶。</li><li>B: Three refers to bags of bread.<br>三袋指面包。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which size should the group choose?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">用品卡<br>小号垫：两个人坐，收起来放进书包。<br>大号垫：四个人坐，需要单独拿。<br>这次四位同学只有一张垫子的预算，大家都想坐在垫子上，不能再借别人的垫子。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两人坐的小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四人坐的大号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两张小号</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>One large mat provides space for all four within the one-mat limit.</p><p class="cn">一张大号容纳四人，符合只买一张的限制。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 大号垫：四个人坐，需要单独拿</p><ul><li>A: A small mat leaves two people without space.<br>小号只有两人位置。</li><li>C: The budget covers one mat, not two.<br>预算只有一张，不能买两张。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. Which amount is the non-refundable one-day usage fee?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">野餐篮租用单<br>一天使用费十元，另交押金二十元。小何先付三十元，店员说明：按时还回完整的篮子，就退二十元押金；十元使用费不退。小何打算当天傍晚按时归还。</p></div><p class="note">押金: refundable deposit</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 二十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三十元</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Ten yuan is explicitly the usage fee that is not returned.</p><p class="cn">十元明确是不会退的使用费。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 十元使用费不退</p><ul><li>B: Twenty yuan is the refundable deposit, not the usage fee.<br>二十元是会退的押金，不是使用费。</li><li>C: Thirty yuan combines the fee and deposit paid initially.<br>三十元是最初一起交的使用费与押金。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Which package fits the facilities described in the note?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">野餐准备<br>公园没有厨房，也没有冰箱。甲套餐是需要加热的生饺子；乙套餐是面包和洗好的苹果，不用加热也不用冷藏；丙套餐要一直冷藏。小组要在公园待三小时，只能带一套。</p></div><p class="note">冷藏: keep refrigerated</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲套餐</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 丙套餐</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙套餐</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Package B needs neither heating nor refrigeration, which the park lacks.</p><p class="cn">乙不用加热冷藏，符合公园设施条件。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 乙套餐是面包和洗好的苹果，不用加热也不用冷藏</p><ul><li>A: Package A requires heating equipment.<br>甲需要公园没有的加热条件。</li><li>B: Package C requires continuous refrigeration.<br>丙需要一直冷藏。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. What has Xiao’an agreed to do immediately after class?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家庭群消息<br>妈妈今天五点到家，小安四点半下课，哥哥六点回来。小狗五点以前要有人接回家。妈妈说自己赶不上，小安答应放学直接去接，哥哥回来以后再带狗出去走走。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 接小狗回家</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 等哥哥六点回来</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先回家等妈妈</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Xiao’an accepts the pickup before the five-o’clock deadline.</p><p class="cn">小安答应在五点期限前直接接狗。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 小安答应放学直接去接</p><ul><li>B: Waiting for the brother misses the deadline.<br>等哥哥六点回来会错过期限。</li><li>C: The mother says she cannot handle the pickup in time.<br>妈妈说自己赶不上，不能先等她处理。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. How is the afternoon expected to compare with early morning?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周日天气表<br>早晨二十三度，微风；下午三十六度，无风；晚上二十七度。运动中心提醒：下午来上课请带水，不要把早晨的凉快当成全天的天气，室外活动尽量避开午后。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 更热，而且没有风</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 更凉快，风更大</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 温度完全一样</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The afternoon is hotter than the twenty-three-degree morning and has no wind.</p><p class="cn">下午三十六度，比早晨热，又无风。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 下午三十六度，无风</p><ul><li>B: Neither cooling nor stronger wind is forecast for the afternoon.<br>下午没有变凉或风更大。</li><li>C: The two temperatures differ.<br>早晚两段温度并不相同。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. Why is the lesson now in the morning?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">课程群消息<br>周二篮球课本来四点开始，现改为上午九点。球场没有比赛，也没有维修。老师说下午太热，希望大家在太阳还不强的时候练习。报名和上课地点都不用改变。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 球场下午有比赛</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 球场需要维修</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 避开下午的高温</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The change avoids the afternoon heat.</p><p class="cn">改时间是为了避开下午高温。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 老师说下午太热，希望大家在太阳还不强的时候练习</p><ul><li>A: The message explicitly rules out a match.<br>群消息明确说没有比赛。</li><li>B: The message explicitly rules out repairs.<br>群消息明确说没有维修。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which plan follows the coach’s practice-and-rest requirement?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">训练安排卡<br>教练要求小林每练习二十分钟，至少休息五分钟再继续。<br>甲：连续练四十分钟。乙：练二十分钟，休息五分钟，再练二十分钟。丙：练二十分钟，休息一分钟，再继续练。小林要选符合要求的安排。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 乙</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Plan B includes the required rest after twenty minutes and before continuing.</p><p class="cn">乙在二十分钟练习后休息五分钟，再继续。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 乙：练二十分钟，休息五分钟，再练二十分钟</p><ul><li>A: Plan A has no break between the two twenty-minute periods.<br>甲连续四十分钟，中间没有规定休息。</li><li>C: Plan C rests for only one minute instead of at least five.<br>丙只休息一分钟，不够至少五分钟。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What must visitors do just after collecting the activity card?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">端午活动须知<br>进门先领取活动卡，再到服务桌盖章。拿到盖章的卡才可以换一份手工材料。完成香包后可以在出口拍照。没有盖章不能领材料，请不要直接到出口排队。</p></div><p class="note">盖章: stamp</p><p class="note">香包: sachet</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 直接领取手工材料</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 到服务桌盖章</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去出口拍照</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The next required step is getting the card stamped.</p><p class="cn">领卡后下一步是到服务桌盖章。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 进门先领取活动卡，再到服务桌盖章</p><ul><li>A: Materials require a stamp first.<br>先盖章才能换材料。</li><li>C: Photos come after finishing the craft.<br>做好手工后才到出口拍照。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What does Xiaohe’s later behaviour suggest?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小何的端午活动记录<br>我第一次来，找不到做香包的教室，工作人员带我过去。活动结束后，我看见新来的同学也在找教室，就陪他走过去，还留在门口给后面的人指路，直到大家都进了教室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 他愿意帮助不熟悉活动的人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 他只想早点独自离开</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 他一直没有找到教室</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Guiding newcomers after being helped suggests willingness to help others.</p><p class="cn">被帮助后留下引路，支持愿意帮助新人的推断。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 还留在门口给后面的人指路，直到大家都进了教室</p><ul><li>B: Staying to guide people contradicts wanting only to leave early alone.<br>留下帮忙与只想独自早走不符。</li><li>C: He reaches the room and later guides others to it.<br>他已经到过教室，还带别人过去。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 20 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 20 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to a sports schedule conflict</h2><p>Reply to Xiaoyu in Chinese. Answer whether you can attend the new badminton session on Tuesday at five and say whether you can bring a racket. Give one reason connected to your availability or equipment. Suggest a workable alternative or ask a relevant question. Invent details if needed. About 40-60 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小何：周三的羽毛球课取消了，小组想改到周二下午五点。你能参加吗？你能带球拍来吗？如果不方便，我们再想别的办法。<br>小雨</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">小雨，周二五点我有课，不能来。我有球拍，周四可以带。我们改到周四五点好吗？那天小组其他同学有空吗？</p></div><ul><li>Answer whether Tuesday at five works for you.</li><li>Say whether you can bring a racket.</li><li>Give a reason related to availability or equipment.</li><li>Suggest a feasible alternative or ask a relevant question.</li></ul><h3>Alternative example</h3><p class="cn">小雨，我周二五点能来，也能带球拍，因为哥哥把他的借给我了。我们在运动中心哪个门见？我想提前十分钟到。</p><ul><li>A refusal with a feasible suggestion is valid.</li><li>A learner can lack a racket and ask about borrowing one.</li><li>Judge completion of the four observations rather than exact wording.</li></ul><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：Answer whether Tuesday at five works for you.；Say whether you can bring a racket.；Give a reason related to availability or equipment.；Suggest a feasible alternative or ask a relevant question.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Tell a classmate about a short trip</h2><p>Use the fictional trip card to describe last Sunday in Chinese. Include when and where the trip happened, at least two actions in a consistent order, and a feeling or reason. You may add plausible details. About 80-120 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">时间：上周日<br>地点：城外的小湖<br>早上：全班坐小巴出发<br>到达后：老师带大家沿湖看鸟<br>中午：在树下吃自带的午饭<br>下午：整理垃圾，再坐车返校<br>感受：自己选择并说明</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">上周日，我们班坐小巴去了城外的小湖。下车后，老师先带我们沿湖看鸟，还教我们拍照。中午，大家在树下吃自己带的午饭。下午，我们整理好垃圾，再坐车回学校。我喜欢这次短途活动，因为能和同学聊天，也看到了平时不常见的鸟。</p></div><ul><li>Identify last Sunday.</li><li>Identify the lake outside town.</li><li>Describe one action on the card.</li><li>Describe a second action in a consistent sequence.</li><li>Give a feeling or a reason.</li></ul><ul><li>A negative feeling with a coherent reason is also acceptable.</li><li>Do not require every time label or the added detail in the reference.</li><li>Different sentence structures may express the same sequence.</li></ul><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：Identify last Sunday.；Identify the lake outside town.；Describe one action on the card.；Describe a second action in a consistent sequence.；Give a feeling or a reason.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Arrange a sports-centre visit</h2><p>A classmate is arranging a visit to the sports centre. Answer four fixed recorded prompts in Chinese. Each prompt plays twice, followed by 15 seconds to prepare and up to 25 seconds to record. Use real or invented details. Four responses are reviewed together as one task out of eight; these prompts are not adaptive.</p><p>Discuss equipment needs, choose an activity, explain your choice, and handle a changed meeting point.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">明天去运动中心，你还需要借什么东西吗？球、球拍，或者别的东西都可以说。</p><p class="cn">Example: 我没有球拍，想借一副。球我已经有了。</p><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">你想参加羽毛球还是游泳？也可以提出另一个运动。</p><p class="cn">Example: 我想参加羽毛球，先跟大家练一练。</p><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">为什么这个运动适合你？告诉我一个理由就可以。</p><p class="cn">Example: 因为我以前学过一点儿，想和同学一起练。</p><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">南门明天不开，我们改在东门见，你觉得怎么样？如果不方便，你有什么办法？</p><p class="cn">Example: 东门可以，我知道怎么走。我们九点在那里见。</p><p class="cn">Alternative: 我不认识东门，能先在公交站见，再一起走过去吗？</p><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：State equipment needed or explain that you need none.；Choose a relevant sport or propose another.；Give a reason relevant to the learner’s own choice.；Accept the new meeting point or propose a workable alternative.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Compare two short trips</h2><p>Recommend one of the two short trips to a classmate who must be back at school by three on Sunday and has forty yuan. Compare the options, state a choice, give two reasons supported by the cards and explain a short plan. If you choose an option with a difficulty, explain how you would manage it. Prepare for 60 seconds and speak for up to 90 seconds.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">周日短途选择<br>甲：学校组织的小湖活动，上午九点出发、下午两点回校，三十五元含往返车费，需要自带午饭。<br>乙：邻城公园，上午十点出发、下午四点回校，二十元含往返车费和午饭；可以提前离开，但提前返程的车费另算，金额未知。<br>同学：下午三点前必须回校，预算四十元，家中已准备好可带走的午饭。</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">我建议选甲。甲要三十五元，比乙贵，但是没有超过四十元。甲两点就回学校，能赶上同学三点以前回校的要求。乙正常四点才回来，提前回来的车费也不知道。我们可以先准备午饭，八点五十分到学校，九点和大家一起出发。</p></div><ul><li>Compare one or more features of both trips.</li><li>Choose a trip.</li><li>Give a first supported reason.</li><li>Give a second supported reason.</li><li>Describe a feasible short plan, including how to handle any chosen constraint.</li></ul><h3>Alternative example</h3><p class="cn">如果选乙，就必须先问清提前回校的车次和另外的车费，确认三点前能到，而且总共不超过四十元。在这些事情没有确认以前，我不会直接建议同学报名乙。</p><ul><li>A meets known time and budget limits.</li><li>B requires a conditional plan; do not assume an unknown return fare is free.</li><li>Do not impose a native accent or a minimum recording length.</li></ul><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：Compare one or more features of both trips.；Choose a trip.；Give a first supported reason.；Give a second supported reason.；Describe a feasible short plan, including how to handle any chosen constraint.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务列出的主要要求，理由或安排与情境一致。</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></main></body></html>